<div id="importer-delivery">
  <h2>Generate an upload URL</h2>
  Generates a URL you can use to upload the legacy alerts file:
  <span id="importer-delivery-upload-url"></span>

  <h2>Generate a download URL</h2>
  Generates a URL you can use to download the legacy alerts file in
  case of debug: <span id="importer-delivery-download-url"></span>

  <h2>Start an import</h2>
  Kick off an import run:

  <.button phx-click="import">Import</.button>
</div>
